  "note": "The identical name Meshech designates a son of Japheth and a people associated with Tubal. Scripture supplies no derivation from this verb. Syriac ܡܫܟܐ “skin” is likewise distinct. The two passages with the common noun offer little basis for a single precise English equivalent."
